  "system": {
    "description": "<p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">You have the @UUID[Compendium.vagabond-app.perks.Item.zqTnJZseG8Q8Pf7Z]{Dusted Knuckle} Perk, and your Equipped Brawl Weapons have the Defense and Vicious properties.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Further, when you roll any damage dice for a Brawl Weapon, you can either:</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Increase your subsequent Brawl damage dice one size until the start of your Turn.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Grapple or Shove them if you viably could. </span><br><br><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Macro:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> @UUID[Compendium.vagabond-app.macros.Macro.9ufjSjTTax3g8oce]{Fisticuffs}</span></p>",
